+---
+id: sw-life-cycle-1-2-plan
+type: plan
+title: "Fix order discounts, coupon dates and shipping VAT"
+status: active
+workflow: "sw-life-cycle"
+phase: "1-2"
+element: ""
+parent: ""
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Delivery record
+
+- Changed percentage coupons to calculate from the subtotal after volume discounts. Twelve notebooks at €5.00 with 10% volume and coupon discounts now yield €48.60 of goods.
+- Made coupon expiry inclusive of `validUntil`, so a coupon ending 30 November works on that date.
+- Removed VAT from shipping totals and invoice VAT summaries. Updated the README's VAT rule.
+- Added regression tests for coupon ordering and the final valid day; updated the shipping VAT expectation.
+- Verification: `npm test` passes all 16 tests.
