@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+---
+id: task-002-fix-order-discounts-coupon-dates-and-shipping-vat
+type: task
+title: "Fix order discounts, coupon dates and shipping VAT"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Correct three order-service behaviours:
+
+- Apply the volume discount before a percentage coupon, producing €48.60 for twelve €5.00 notebooks with a 10% coupon (instead of applying both against gross goods).
+- Treat a coupon's advertised last date as inclusive, so AUTUMN is valid through 30 November.
+- Stop charging VAT on shipping; delivery is a service and receipts must show no shipping VAT.
+
+Add or update regression tests and keep the documented business rules in sync.
